cube-example-apps (2.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Snake: add player-count start menu using cube::GameStartMenu; AI fills
    empty slots.
  * Fix IMU per-frame snapshot in PixelFlow and PixelFlow2; resolves severe
    frame-rate regression caused by reading sysfs on every inner loop iteration.
  * Fix Genetic app loop pacing deadlock and optimise random generator.
  * Fix Breakout3D CubeApp registration name (was mismatched, causing
    launch failures via cubed).
  * Persist Snake high score robustly (recursive directory creation).
  * Persist Breakout3D high score to /var/lib/cube/apps/breakout3d/.
  * Update install path for all apps to /usr/libexec/cube/apps/.

 -- Björn Hauffe <oss@64b.de>  Tue, 02 Jun 2026 17:01:12 +0200

cube-example-apps (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for LED Cube example applications.
  * Migrated all applications to libcube 2.0 with clean C++20 and standalone builds.
  * Added manifest.toml and schema.toml configuration for every application.

